# The keyring files verify takes from each keyring_image: the trust root of
# every target outside x86_64. One line per file: TAG<TAB>FILE<TAB>SHA256.
# CI (ci.yml job keyrings) compares this with scripts/keyring-files; a
# change here is a change of trusted keys, and a person reviews it.
